  Former fork: https://github.com/zlnick/iris-terminology-server
  Credit for that terminology server belongs to its author. Consult the
  historical component's own license and copyright notices if reusing it.
- Former terminology materials referenced GB/T 14396-2016 ICD-10, China NRDL
